EngagementIndexPage.description:
The P-36 envelope: `counts` per engagement status minus the selected tile (the seven tiles;
`declined` never shows), `facets.service_line` the segments; both from one grouped query. The
tiles sum to `total`.

post.description:
Human-only: pending grants and a single-use invitation in one unit of work and
`contact.invited` emitted; 409 `gate_unmet` (G1) for a full-client grant before acceptance;
422 `scope_outside_client`.

put.description:
AC-28: off, a new support-session request answers 409 `support_requests_disabled`;
sessions already granted keep their expiry. 409 `stale_version`. Audited
`support_access.updated`.

post.description:
The raw `.xlsx` workbook is the request body (TASK-023 D3: no multipart dependency).
`engagement_type` (repeatable) tags a new template with the types it serves (SPEC-024);
an existing template keeps its own.
